#: app/templates/base/about.html:13 app/templates/base/faq.html:15
msgid "What is Myeline?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:15
msgid ""
"Myeline is a platform for monitoring documents and querying them with AI "
"— designed for professionals who need to stay informed without "
"compromising confidentiality."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:18
msgid ""
"Connect your RSS feeds, add web pages, plug in your cloud drives (Google "
"Drive, OneDrive, Dropbox, Zotero, S3, WebDAV…) so Myeline can index your "
"files (PDF, Word…), and ask questions in natural language. The AI answers"
" by citing its sources. Document understanding happens locally on our "
"servers; the AI that writes the answer is Mistral AI, a French provider "
"hosted in the European Union, contractually committed to never train on "
"your data."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:21
msgid ""
"For regulated industries that need everything to stay on-site, our "
"sovereign / on-premise edition runs the full AI pipeline inside your "
"infrastructure — no external API call ever leaves your network."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:26
msgid "The project"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:35
msgid ""
"Myeline was born from a simple need: having a tool that centralises, "
"indexes, and makes searchable the sources that matter — without sending "
"data to third parties. Clara designed and developed the platform as an "
"independent project, with a focus on privacy and local processing."
msgstr ""

