msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:49 app/templates/base/home.html:370
msgid "Independence"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:50
msgid ""
"No advertising. No commercial partnerships. Our only clients are our "
"subscribers. No external influence on the platform's content or "
"direction."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:56
msgid "Privacy first"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:57
msgid ""
"Document understanding stays on our servers. The AI that writes the "
"answers is Mistral AI — French provider, EU-hosted, contractually "
"committed not to train on your data. Sensitive data is encrypted at rest."
" Sovereign / on-premise deployments keep everything inside your "
"infrastructure — no external call at all. Infrastructure hosted in "
"France, GDPR-compliant."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:63
msgid "Useful by design"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/about.html:64
msgid ""
"Every answer cites its sources with a relevance score. The tool is "
"designed to augment your judgment, not replace it. Transparency over "
"magic."
msgstr ""

