#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:385
msgid "How does the 15-day free trial work?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:390
msgid ""
"Click Start on the Pro card — no credit card required. You get full Pro "
"features for 15 days (custom RSS sources, watch alerts, multi-turn chat, "
"no daily quota). On day 16 your account switches to read-only: you can "
"still see your indexed documents and past queries, but you'll need to "
"pick a paid plan to keep indexing or querying. Your data is preserved for"
" 45 days after the trial ends, then permanently deleted (GDPR Art. 5)."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:400
msgid "Where is my data stored?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:405
msgid ""
"Default deployment is on European infrastructure (France). Embeddings "
"stay local on the Myeline server (Ollama). LLM synthesis hits Mistral AI,"
" also EU-hosted (France). Sovereign / on-premise deployments never leave "
"your network."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:415
msgid "Can I switch plans at any time?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:420
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Yes — upgrades take effect immediately and are pro-rated. Downgrades take"
" effect at the end of the current billing period. Yearly billing gives "
"you 20%% off and can be picked at signup or on upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:430
msgid "What happens if I cancel?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:435
msgid ""
"Your account stays active until the end of the paid period. You can "
"export all your data (Art. 15 + 20 GDPR ZIP including RAG chunks) at any "
"time, before or after cancelling. Real account deletion erases data "
"within 30 days."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:445
msgid "Do you train AI models on my data?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:450
msgid ""
"No. Mistral AI commits contractually not to train on customer API data. "
"Embeddings are local and never leave the Myeline server. In sovereign "
"mode, no external AI is called at all."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:460
msgid "Why is Enterprise priced from 590 €/month?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:465
msgid ""
"Enterprise gets an isolated stack, choice of LLM provider with your own "
"API key, OIDC SSO, signed DPA, custom SLA, dedicated support and "
"onboarding. The price reflects operational + contractual commitments, not"
" just quotas. Custom quotas are negotiated based on your team size and "
"usage profile."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:475
msgid "Can I host Myeline myself?"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/base/pricing.html:480
msgid ""
"On-premise / sovereign deployment is available for organisations that "
"need their data to never leave their infrastructure — we install on your "
"servers, sign a DPA, and provide ongoing support and version upgrades. "
"See the Sovereign edition page for details."
msgstr ""

